{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GMNReservedTag","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This is the payload of ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/reserved(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", one of the two untyped","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lanes of the tag model: a name, an optional identifier, a flat list of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parameters, and a body of scoped symbols. Nothing here is interpreted — the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parameters are whatever was written, in the order they were written, bound","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to nothing.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"text":"What lands here, and for how long","anchor":"What-lands-here-and-for-how-long","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Three names land here ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"permanently"}]},{"text":", by decision rather than by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"omission: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\port"},{"type":"text","text":", which GMN reserves but treats as a no-op, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\DrHoos"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\DrRenz","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which fall outside the 59-payload catalog. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"catalog is closed, so this set does not grow or shrink.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Everything else that lands here is ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"temporary, and lasts until the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"normalizer runs"}]},{"text":". The parser never repairs and never discards, so a tag","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whose parameters do not yet bind cleanly arrives here intact: an unknown","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parameter, a raw identifier, a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$variable"},{"text":", a unit on a slot that cannot","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carry one, a value of the wrong type. ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" repairs each of"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"those and re-runs promotion, which is why ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a parsed score is less typed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than a normalized one"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"After ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/normalize(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" returns, the only names left on this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lane are the three above and the ones a defect no repair could reach kept","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"off a typed lane. Staying here is what carries such a tag to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator","type":"reference"},{"text":", which reports it — see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"What-does-not-land-here","type":"heading","text":"What does not land here","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A name GMN does not reserve at all is ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/custom(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":", not this.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The distinction is drawn where tags are built, by the parser, which tests","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the name and sends it down one lane or the other.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Read-never-written","type":"heading","text":"Read, never written","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This payload has no public initializer. Every value of it comes from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNParser","type":"reference"},{"text":", and the reason is that its admission rule is ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"reservation"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rather than the three permanent names above: a lossless parser has to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carry ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\beam<bogus=1>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" before the normalizer repairs it, so any rule","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"narrow enough to keep a hand-built score well formed would be too narrow","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for the parser. Rather than pick one and lose the other, the lane is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"readable but not constructible — a hand-built tag reaches its meaning","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"through a typed payload, or through ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag","type":"reference"},{"text":" for a name GMN does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not reserve.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The three permanent residents are the price: none of ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\port","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\DrHoos","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\DrRenz","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" can be written into a hand-built score, though each still","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"round-trips a parsed one untouched.","type":"text"}]}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Tags","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag"],"title":"Tags"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmnreservedtag"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNReservedTag","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GMNReservedTag","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GMNReservedTag","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorGMN14GMNReservedTagV","title":"GMNReservedTag","symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"IvorGMN"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"A Guido Music Notation tag whose name GMN reserves but no typed payload","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"claims, carried in its untyped, as-written form.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/I